WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.691
Namaste. Is video mein hum wo saare features dekhenge jo pichhle videos mein nahi aaye.

00:00:05.691 --> 00:00:08.308
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:17.728
Ye More menu mein rehte hain, aur har ek ka apna kaam hai: customer ki maang likhna, purani copy se data lana, staff, branches, plan, aur madad.

00:00:17.728 --> 00:00:19.691
Hum grocery demo par dekhenge.

00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:24.461
Ye More menu hai, saare features ki puri list, groups mein.

00:00:24.461 --> 00:00:32.298
Sales and money mein bills, petty cash aur catalog. Stock mein products, stock audit, reorder aur expiry.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:35.284
People mein parties, staff aur branches.

00:00:35.284 --> 00:00:44.539
Grow your business mein reminders, offers, loyalty, birthdays, festival planner, profit leak, shelf watch aur item requests.

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:51.331
Import and quick entry mein purani khata aur register ka import. Aur neeche settings. Kyun?

00:00:51.331 --> 00:00:57.228
Kyunki bhale sab kuch bottom bar mein na ho, har feature ek hi jagah milta hai.

00:00:57.609 --> 00:01:00.968
Upar ka search box. Yahan kuch bhi likho, jaise Ajay.

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:06.101
Ye products, customers, bills aur screens, sab mein ek saath dhoondhta hai. Kyun?

00:01:06.101 --> 00:01:10.980
Kyunki kisi bhi screen se kisi bhi cheez tak ek hi tarah jaana sabse tez hai.

00:01:17.255 --> 00:01:19.874
Aur ye chamakta hua button, A I assistant.

00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:24.489
Isse hindi ya english mein kuch bhi poochho, jaise Aaj kitna business hua.

00:01:24.489 --> 00:01:29.105
Jawab aapke apne data se aata hai: total sales aur kitna udhaar par. Kyun?

00:01:29.105 --> 00:01:35.466
Kyunki har report kholne ke bajay ek sawal likhna aasan hai. Ye Preferences se chalu ya band hota hai.

00:01:35.831 --> 00:01:42.683
Item Requests. Customer ne kuch maanga jo aapke paas nahi tha, jaise pacchis kilo atta ka special brand.

00:01:42.683 --> 00:01:49.733
Use yahan likh lo: customer ka naam, phone, item, aur agar advance diya ho to wo, aur kab tak aayega. Kyun?

00:01:49.733 --> 00:01:57.442
Kyunki bina likhe wo customer kahin aur chala jata hai, aur likhne se aap aane par ek tap mein WhatsApp kar sakte ho.

00:01:57.823 --> 00:02:03.940
Item aa gaya to Mark available dabao. Customer ko ek tap mein WhatsApp message tayyar.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:07.354
Ye chhoti si baat customer ko bandhe rakhti hai.

00:02:07.726 --> 00:02:13.704
Win them back. Wo regular customer jo pehle har kuch din mein aate the aur ab aana band kar diye.

00:02:13.704 --> 00:02:21.838
App har customer ko uski apni aadat se compare karta hai, jaise Amit More jo har paanch din mein aata tha aur tees din se nahi aaya.

00:02:21.838 --> 00:02:24.981
Send win back message se ek tap mein message. Kyun?

00:02:24.981 --> 00:02:28.617
Kyunki purana customer wapas laana naya laane se sasta hai.

00:02:28.991 --> 00:02:35.018
Staff performance. Kis staff ne kitni bikri ki, kitne bill, aur kitna paisa collect kiya.

00:02:35.018 --> 00:02:37.591
Tareekh badal kar dekh sakte ho. Kyun?

00:02:37.591 --> 00:02:42.602
Kyunki kai staff ho to mehnat aur bharose ka faisla is number se hota hai.

00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:43.937
Bulk Sale Entry.

00:02:43.937 --> 00:02:51.461
Agar aapke paas purane bills ka register hai ya din bhar ke bill ek saath likhne hain, to yahan table jaisa fast entry hai.

00:02:51.461 --> 00:02:58.190
Customer ka naam, tareekh, amount aur poora paid ya udhaar ka tick. Ramesh Traders ka pandrah sau likhte hain.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:04.369
Save dabate hi bill ban jata hai. Kyun? Kyunki kabhi kabhi din ke end mein bhi entry karni padti hai.

00:03:04.746 --> 00:03:09.857
Import old khata. Purani kaagaz ki khata copy ke har page ki photo kheencho.

00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:16.649
A I har customer ka naam aur abhi ka baaki amount padh leta hai aur use editable entry bana deta hai.

00:03:16.649 --> 00:03:20.819
Save karne se pehle aap sab dekh kar theek kar sakte ho. Kyun?

00:03:20.819 --> 00:03:29.023
Kyunki paper se app par aane ka sabse mushkil kaam khata dobara likhna hota hai, aur ye use kuch minute mein kar deta hai.

00:03:29.023 --> 00:03:32.117
Ye A I ka kaam hai, isliye demo mein band hai.

00:03:32.492 --> 00:03:34.373
Import old sales register.

00:03:34.373 --> 00:03:44.866
Purane sales register ke pages ki photo, aur har row, yaani tareekh, customer aur amount, ek asli bill ban jaati hai, us din ki tareekh ke saath.

00:03:44.866 --> 00:03:50.583
Kyun? Kyunki purani bikri ke reports bhi sahi dikhne chahiye, sirf aaj se nahi.

00:03:50.952 --> 00:03:56.415
Scan a price list. Kisi bhi price list, menu card ya vendor ki rate list ki photo kheencho.

00:03:56.415 --> 00:04:02.539
Item ka naam aur price padh kar list bana deta hai, aur aap save karne se pehle review karte ho. Kyun?

00:04:02.539 --> 00:04:08.363
Kyunki sau items haath se type karne mein ghante lagte hain, aur ye kuch minute mein ho jata hai.

00:04:14.402 --> 00:04:18.148
Shelf Watch. Har shelf ko ek naam do, jaise Grocery Rack ek.

00:04:18.148 --> 00:04:24.891
Har baar us shelf ki photo kheencho aur A I pichhli photo se compare karke batata hai kya kam dikh raha hai.

00:04:24.891 --> 00:04:25.203
Kyun?

00:04:25.203 --> 00:04:32.133
Kyunki jo dukaan mein hazaar item ho wahan har cheez ka stock ginna mushkil hai, aur photo se kaam ho jata hai.

00:04:32.504 --> 00:04:39.708
Today's Highlight. Aaj ki bikri ka ek sundar card, jise aap WhatsApp status ya Instagram story par lagate ho.

00:04:39.708 --> 00:04:43.607
Isme aaj ki khaas cheezein, dukaan ka naam aur bikri. Kyun?

00:04:43.607 --> 00:04:49.555
Kyunki customer ko dikhta rehta hai ki dukaan chal rahi hai, aur ye free ka marketing hai.

00:04:49.933 --> 00:04:50.348
Staff.

00:04:50.348 --> 00:05:03.958
Yahan owner apne staff ke alag login banata hai: Staff, Manager ya Owner ka role, aur har ek ke permissions, yaani kaun bill dekh sakta hai, kaun discount de sakta hai, kaun reports dekh sakta hai.

00:05:03.958 --> 00:05:10.591
Kyun? Kyunki har kisi ko poori dukaan ka access dene se chori aur galti dono ka khatra hota hai.

00:05:10.591 --> 00:05:15.704
Demo mein staff jodna band hai kyunki ye shop sab ke saath share hota hai.

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:22.667
Branches. Agar aapki ek se zyada shop hain, to sab ek hi account mein, alag alag branch ke naam se.

00:05:22.667 --> 00:05:28.520
Staff ko branch mein daalte hain aur unke bill us branch ke naam se tag hote hain. Kyun?

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:34.773
Kyunki alag alag login aur alag alag hisaab ke bajay ek hi jagah se poora kaarobar dikhta hai.

00:05:35.138 --> 00:05:42.323
Plan and billing. Free plan mein sau bill mahine ke, saath items, ek login, aur GST reports hamesha free.

00:05:42.323 --> 00:05:47.934
Basic ek hazaar nau sau ninyanave rupaye saal ka, unlimited bills aur teen logins.

00:05:47.934 --> 00:05:53.409
Pro chaar hazaar ke kareeb, profit report, online orders aur staff ki jimmedari.

00:05:53.409 --> 00:05:56.693
Pro plus aur custom bade business ke liye. Kyun?

00:05:56.693 --> 00:06:02.989
Kyunki chhoti dukaan free se shuru kare aur badhne par upgrade kare, jo use chahiye wahi de.

00:06:03.353 --> 00:06:09.984
Help and guide. Har screen aur button ka jawab sawal jawab ki tarah, jaise health score kya hai.

00:06:09.984 --> 00:06:16.685
Kisi sawal par tap karo to jawab khulta hai. Aur upar Watch tour again se pura tour dobara. Kyun?

00:06:16.685 --> 00:06:20.484
Kyunki naya staff bina kisi ko poochhe khud seekh sake.

00:06:21.915 --> 00:06:22.780
Aur Profile.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:39.569
Dukaan ka naam, subscription kab tak valid hai, Install app on this device, yaani app ko phone par icon ki tarah lagana, aur GST profile, thermal print, invoice design, preferences, barcode scanning aur help ke shortcut, aur Log out.

00:06:39.569 --> 00:06:45.766
Kyun? Kyunki install karne se ye normal app jaisa khulta hai, aur Android app bhi hai.

00:06:46.144 --> 00:07:03.898
Aaj humne baaki saare features dekhe: More menu, search, A I assistant, item requests, win back, staff performance, bulk sale entry, A I se purani khata aur register aur price list ka import, shelf watch, highlight card, staff aur branches, plans, help aur profile.

00:07:03.898 --> 00:07:08.721
Ek practical baat: pehle hafte sirf billing, khata aur reports use karo.

00:07:08.721 --> 00:07:15.555
Uske baad har hafte ek naya feature chalu karo, aur The Ray dhire dhire aapka poora office ban jayega.
